OL,3,GNEWSAVictims describe 'house of terror'
OL,4,Aabuse by mother, grandmother and
OL,5,Astepfather
OL,6,
OL,7,FA mother, grandmother and stepfather
OL,8,Fwho subjected three children to years
OL,9,Fof abuse in a "house of terror" have
OL,10,Favoided jail.
OL,12,FShirley Freeman, Julia Stephen and
OL,13,FDavid McColl's victims were beaten,
OL,14,Fstarved and psychologically tormented
OL,15,Fbetween 2003 and 2012.
OL,17,FFreeman, 51, and Stephen, 69, were
OL,18,Fearlier found guilty of cruel and
OL,19,Funnatural treatment. McColl, 50,
OL,20,Fadmitted the crimes.
